      "time": 1787227478,
      "text": "I trained a 125M-parameter transformer to autocomplete piano performances in real time (~108 notes&#x2F;sec on an iPhone 15).<p>The idea is basically GitHub Copilot or Tabnine, except instead of prompting it with code, you prompt it by playing a few notes on a MIDI piano. The model then continues what you played, entirely on-device.<p>The app is free if anyone wants to try it. Happy to answer questions about the model, training, Core ML, or the many things that didn&#x27;t work.",
